  E -->|violation| X
  E --> F[6 De-duplicate by text hash]
  F --> G[7 Embed + L2-normalise]
  G --> H[8 FAISS IndexFlatIP]
  H --> I[9 Persist index, chunks.jsonl, manifest, embedder, ingest_report]
